flowchart LR
    Q["Request"] --> R{"Router: is the right tool<br/>among its top 3?"}
    R -->|"no: selection miss"| D["The model searches with discover_tools,<br/>picks a neighbour, or only replies"]
    D --> M
    R -->|yes| M{"Model: does it pick<br/>the right tool?"}
    M -->|"no: confusion, or nothing done"| W["The handler asks again<br/>in plainer words"]
    W --> R
    M -->|yes| T{"Tool: are the<br/>arguments accepted?"}
    T -->|"no: calling error"| E["The model reads the error<br/>and tries again"]
    E --> T
    T -->|yes| A["Answer"]
